# Project Context

## Purpose

- Impress visitors
- Serve as a portfolio for my past coding projects
- Give visitors an idea of what I'm like as a person and as a creative
- Demonstrate my skills as a Software Engineer
- Give visitors the means to contact me

## Tech Stack

- React 18 + TypeScript
- Vite for bundling
- React Router for routing
- Material UI with custom theme (defined in `theme.ts`)

## Project Structure

- src/pages/ - Page components
- src/components/ - Reusable components
- src/utils/ - Utility functions

## Coding Preferences

- Use functional components with hooks (no class components)
- TypeScript for all new files
- Prefer named exports over default exports
- Keep utilities in separate files under src/utils/
- Follow existing component patterns for consistency
- Follow modern best practices whenever possible

## Forms & Security

- Using Cloudflare Turnstile for bot protection

## Deployment

- Deploys automatically on pushes to remote main using GitHub actions.

